    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests escape handling in {@link StringSubstitutor}. <p>The default escape character is {@code '$'}. A run of five {@code '$'} immediately before a {@code \"${...}\"} expression collapses to four {@code '$'}, and because the expression ends up escaped it is left as a literal rather than being substituted.</p>"
   },
